&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an MLX Metal bug that could reduce output quality for NVFP4 models, particularly Laguna.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.32.4...v0.32.5&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v0.32.4...v0.32.5&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;vLLM v0.26.0 Release Notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This release features 411 commits from 212 contributors (61 new)!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Inkling model family&lt;/strong&gt; with a full support stack: base modeling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4898170598&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48799&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48799/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48799&quot;&gt;#48799&lt;/a&gt;), piecewise CUDA graph support (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4899688891&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48822&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48822/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48822&quot;&gt;#48822&lt;/a&gt;), Hopper FA4 relative attention (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4904341054&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48858&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48858/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48858&quot;&gt;#48858&lt;/a&gt;), MTP=1 speculative decoding (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4904726678&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48869&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48869/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48869&quot;&gt;#48869&lt;/a&gt;), LoRA (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4906043266&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48884&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48884/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48884&quot;&gt;#48884&lt;/a&gt;), and standard ModelOpt NVFP4 quantization (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4915144372&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48990&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48990/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48990&quot;&gt;#48990&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek-V4 performance push&lt;/strong&gt; across vendors: a specialized routing kernel (2.94% E2E TPOT, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4887407554&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48660&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48660/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48660&quot;&gt;#48660&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;code&gt;fused_topk_bias&lt;/code&gt; (1.5–2x kernel, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4797185825&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47463&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47463/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47463&quot;&gt;#47463&lt;/a&gt;), and redundant repeat/copy removal (1.8% E2E TPOT, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4847786234&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48137&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48137/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48137&quot;&gt;#48137&lt;/a&gt;), plus ROCm two-stage compressor for HCA prefill (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4817723742&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47718&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47718/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47718&quot;&gt;#47718&lt;/a&gt;), sparse decode/prefill optimizations (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4876359832&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48519&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48519/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48519&quot;&gt;#48519&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4896417093&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48788&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48788/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48788&quot;&gt;#48788&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4709739589&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46275&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46275/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46275&quot;&gt;#46275&lt;/a&gt;), and DSpark speculative decoding on AMD (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4793204497&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47419&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47419/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47419&quot;&gt;#47419&lt;/a&gt;) and XPU (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4815455307&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47677&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47677/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47677&quot;&gt;#47677&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;fp32 &lt;code&gt;lm_head&lt;/code&gt; for generation models via &lt;code&gt;head_dtype&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4865770555&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48390&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48390/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48390&quot;&gt;#48390&lt;/a&gt;), extended to the LoRA path (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4876683627&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48525&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48525/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48525&quot;&gt;#48525&lt;/a&gt;) and given a ROCm &lt;code&gt;torch.mm&lt;/code&gt; fast path (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4889079505&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48688&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48688/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48688&quot;&gt;#48688&lt;/a&gt;), improving accuracy for generation heads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible attention backends&lt;/strong&gt;: the attention backend can now be selected per KV-cache group (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4838859413&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48012&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48012/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48012&quot;&gt;#48012&lt;/a&gt;), and sliding-window support is now an explicit backend capability (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4838857429&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48011&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48011/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48011&quot;&gt;#48011&lt;/a&gt;) — improving support for hybrid models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KV offloading &amp;amp; tiered secondary storage&lt;/strong&gt; matured substantially: offloading metrics (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4686495455&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/45958&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45958/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/45958&quot;&gt;#45958&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4815040329&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47666&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47666/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47666&quot;&gt;#47666&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4815540456&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47679&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47679/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47679&quot;&gt;#47679&lt;/a&gt;), tier-owned event handling (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4730173870&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/46544&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46544/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/46544&quot;&gt;#46544&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4832437362&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47923&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47923/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47923&quot;&gt;#47923&lt;/a&gt;), object-store secondary tier with workload identity (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4770448030&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47063&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47063/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47063&quot;&gt;#47063&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4784029438&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47274&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47274/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47274&quot;&gt;#47274&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4848732378&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48150&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48150/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48150&quot;&gt;#48150&lt;/a&gt;), DP-replica-aware tiering (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4837108172&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47987&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47987/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47987&quot;&gt;#47987&lt;/a&gt;), and encoder-cache (EC) connectors including CPU offloading (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4430409580&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/42433&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42433/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/42433&quot;&gt;#42433&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4793558400&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47423&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47423/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47423&quot;&gt;#47423&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rust frontend&lt;/strong&gt; gained multimodal video (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4834209356&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47959&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47959/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47959&quot;&gt;#47959&lt;/a&gt;) and audio (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4879775839&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48554&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48554/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48554&quot;&gt;#48554&lt;/a&gt;), a Seed-OSS tool parser (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4819459990&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47741&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47741/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47741&quot;&gt;#47741&lt;/a&gt;), and a native &lt;code&gt;vllm-bench&lt;/code&gt; port (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4844958518&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48107&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48107/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48107&quot;&gt;#48107&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformers 5.13.0&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4828446584&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47867&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47867/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47867&quot;&gt;#47867&lt;/a&gt;) with more models migrated to the Transformers modeling backend: Olmo/Olmo2 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4844443857&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48100&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48100/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48100&quot;&gt;#48100&lt;/a&gt;), MistralLarge3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4848839694&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/48153&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48153/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/48153&quot;&gt;#48153&lt;/a&gt;), and HunyuanVL (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4829045471&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/47872&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47872/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/47872&quot;&gt;#47872&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
